# models.list — every file provision.sh downloads (skipped when already present).
# Format (pipe-delimited, NOT tabs):
#   kind|filename|source|source_id|subdir|wf:workflow-ids
#
# kind     folder under /workspace/models (subdir overrides it):
#            checkpoint lora vae vae_approx clip clip_vision text_encoder diffusion
#            upscale embedding controlnet detection sams model_patch audio_encoder
#            latent_upscale  (any other kind = a folder with the same name)
#          workflow = a ComfyUI workflow (.json, or a .zip of .json files), installed
#            into /workspace/comfyui-user/default/workflows
# source   hf       repo_id::path/in/repo  (path defaults to filename; the local
#                   filename may differ from the repo path, which renames it)
#          civitai  model VERSION id (needs CIVITAI_TOKEN); version_id::member
#                   extracts one file from a .zip release
#          url      direct URL
#          bundled  file inside config/ (e.g. workflows/x.json)
# subdir   optional folder under models/ (e.g. loras/MINIMAX); empty = kind default
# wf:      comma-separated workflow ids from catalog.txt. No tag = global.
#          "wf:global,<id>" installs the line for both `global` and <id>.
#
# A workflow with config/patches/<filename>.patch.json is patched after download.
# Adding your own Civitai file: open the model, pick the version, copy the number
# from its download URL (/api/download/models/<VERSION_ID>):
#   lora|my-style.safetensors|civitai|VERSION_ID||wf:krea2

# ===== global (no tag) ================================================
# IntoRealism ZIT V9.0: Z-Image Turbo photorealism checkpoint, fp8 (5.9 GB)
checkpoint|intorealism_zitV90.safetensors|civitai|3258780||

# ===== qwen21 + qwen21-edit (Qwen-Image 2.1) ===========================
# Official Comfy-Org 2.1 weights + Lenovo UltraReal "v1.0 Qwen2.1" LoRA (Civitai 3349565).
# Creator settings: cfg 3-4 (1 if the image turns to slop), beta scheduler,
# res_2s / res_2m / res_multistep (RES4LYF); example 50 steps, cfg 4, res_2s, LoRA 0.7.
diffusion|qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1::diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors||wf:qwen21,qwen21-edit
text_encoder|qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1::text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors||wf:qwen21,qwen21-edit
vae|qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors|hf|Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1::vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors||wf:qwen21,qwen21-edit
lora|lenovo_qwen21.safetensors|civitai|3349565||wf:qwen21,qwen21-edit
# Official templates PINNED to 371a7b7 (2026-09-20), the revision these weights match.
# Later revisions (99e3d43, 2026-09-25) add a 9.5 GB Qwen3.5-9B prompt-enhancer
# encoder to each template; REFERENCE.md explains how to opt in.
workflow|image_qwen_image_2_1_t2i.json|url|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/371a7b7171bbd11e9cc92ef615ba5ad223d7e5b4/templates/image_qwen_image_2_1_t2i.json||wf:qwen21
workflow|image_qwen_image_2_1_image_edit.json|url|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/371a7b7171bbd11e9cc92ef615ba5ad223d7e5b4/templates/image_qwen_image_2_1_image_edit.json||wf:qwen21-edit

# ===== krea2 (Krea 2 text-to-image) =====================================
