# ===== minimax-h3 (MiniMax H3 / Hailuo 3.0 all-in-one) ===================
# Graph: "MiniMax H3 All-in-One Workflow" by Alice_AIisinWonderland, Civitai model
# 2913151, EN version 3295505 (3295435 = the identical graph with Japanese notes).
# Login-gated: fetched on-instance with CIVITAI_TOKEN, never committed. Needs ComfyUI
# >= 0.30.0. Modes 01-03 (T2V / I2V / first-last frame) run on the FL2VA UNet;
# 04-07 (reference-to-video + DWPose / DensePose / SCAIL-NLF motion tracking) on REF2VA.
# Never recolour the graph's groups: its panels find their groups by colour.
workflow|minimaxH3AllInOneWorkflowEN_enV10.json|civitai|3295505||wf:minimax-h3
