lora|Instareal_low.safetensors|civitai|2124694::Instareal_low.safetensors||wf:wan-animate
# Pose + face detection (ComfyUI-WanAnimatePreprocess reads models/detection).
# The ViTPose-H ONNX comes in two files that must sit in the same folder.
detection|vitpose_h_wholebody_model.onnx|hf|Kijai/vitpose_comfy::onnx/vitpose_h_wholebody_model.onnx||wf:wan-animate
detection|vitpose_h_wholebody_data.bin|hf|Kijai/vitpose_comfy::onnx/vitpose_h_wholebody_data.bin||wf:wan-animate
