# SeC-4B segmentation (Comfyui-SecNodes reads models/sams). fp8 kept for parity with
# the uploaded graph; current SecNodes upcasts fp8 to fp16 at load. If segmentation
# fails, un-comment fp16 (7.9 GB), re-run, and pick it in the SeC Model Loader.
sams|SeC-4B-fp8.safetensors|hf|VeryAladeen/Sec-4B::SeC-4B-fp8.safetensors||wf:wan-animate
# sams|SeC-4B-fp16.safetensors|hf|VeryAladeen/Sec-4B::SeC-4B-fp16.safetensors||wf:wan-animate

